t Jumpstart. Next up, $159k the jumpstart gets full Ready-Made-Characters, and at $162k a novella.<br /> <br /> *checks the excerpt from the Storytelling chapter and suggested genres. sees &quot;solarpunk&quot;*<br /> <br /> HAH. VINDICATION!! Because it makes <i>absolutely no goddamn sense</i> that the Union would stand by and just let climate change happen.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-21T23:01:25-07:00","id":1390711,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1384442-m20-technocracy-reloaded-kickstarter-discussion?p=1390708#post1390708\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Alright, the Art Budget increase AND a Technocrat Jumpstart. Next up, $159k the jumpstart gets full Ready-Made-Characters, and at $162k a novella.<br /> <br /> *checks the excerpt from the Storytelling chapter and suggested genres. sees &quot;solarpunk&quot;*<br /> <br /> HAH. VINDICATION!! Because it makes <i>absolutely no goddamn sense</i> that the Union would stand by and just let climate change happen.</div> </div> </div> </div>at my table the Syndicate faction in bed with the corporate money behind climate change denial rationalize that climate change is a \u201cmarket correction\u201d (paradox from the consensus still adjusting to post-industrialization consumption levels) to be ridden out. Worst thing to do is have the consensus fully embrace it as a feature of reality.<br /> <br /> But the Technocracy Reloaded take of the Union having lost control of the beast they built, and now in damage control, works well with them being both guilty of helping lead the world to this point and on the right side of the issue now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 05-23-2020, 04:54 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-22T00:52:45-07:00","id":1390723,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Marko Markoko</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1384442-m20-technocracy-reloaded-kickstarter-discussion?p=1388501#post1388501\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I do not know if it was a fluke of timing 